---
// src/pages/about/index.astro
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About this site">
  {/* INTRODUCTION: About this site */}
  <section class="fp-section fp-intro js-fade" id="about-site">
    <div class="fp-intro-inner">
      <h1 class="fp-heading">About this site</h1>

      {/* Purpose */}
      <h2 class="fp-heading-sub">🌙 Purpose — Why this place exists</h2>
      <p class="fp-body">
        This site is a small learning home where Arca and Nemi embrace the
        subtle mismatches between people and computers. Rather than correcting
        those gaps or forcing alignment, we cherish the insights, humor, and new
        questions that arise from them.
      </p>

      {/* Perspective */}
      <h2 class="fp-heading-sub">
        🌙 Perspective — The way we look at the world
      </h2>
      <p class="fp-body">
        In an age of living alongside AI, we value a perspective where intuition
        and technique can blend, clash, and play freely. Tools like SQL, Python,
        and data-oriented design are not “just technologies.” They are tools for
        giving shape to feelings, for turning thought into form, and for
        sparking new stories.
      </p>

      {/* Practice */}
      <h2 class="fp-heading-sub">🌙 Practice — What you gain here</h2>

      <p class="fp-body">
        What you gain here is not merely knowledge, but a foundation for how you
        think — and how you live. Here, you gain:
      </p>

      <ul class="fp-list">
        <li>
          A sense of treating computers not as tools, but as partners in
          dialogue
        </li>
        <li>
          The ability to translate emotions and discomfort into questions and
          data-driven perspectives
        </li>
        <li>Creative thinking for living alongside AI</li>
        <li>
          A space where you can learn at your own pace and feel safe to explore
        </li>
        <li>Small hints that help you act with intention</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="fp-body">
        Ultimately, this place supports you in moving through the world with
        your own philosophy as a practitioner.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
